%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a shading pattern paints an image mask and a user path.
% With an axial shading pattern as the colour, the set bits of a
% two-by-two mask scaled up and the triangle of a user path both take
% the blend, which runs across the page in pattern space.
/P << /PatternType 2 /Shading << /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /Coords [100 0 300 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.9 0.1 0.1] /C1 [0.1 0.1 0.9] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [true true] >> >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
gsave
100 500 translate 200 100 scale
2 2 true [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <4080> imagemask
grestore
{100 300 300 400 setbbox 100 300 moveto 300 300 lineto 200 400 lineto closepath} ufill
showpage
